                <pb facs="0823" n="735" xml:id="pg735"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. McCormick to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic">St.
                            Petersburg</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-08-02"><hi rendition="#italic">August 2,
                        1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. McCormick reports that the minister for foreign affairs has advised him that
                    on July 22 the <hi rendition="#italic">Arabia</hi> was seized by Russian naval
                    authorities and was taken to Vladivostok and that the prize court there will
                    have to decide whether she is to be treated as a prize or not.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
